---
// Closing credits: summary, actions and the logo strip.

---
<section class="slide bg-black s-end" id="credits" data-ink="#FFF" data-label="Credits" data-fx="fade" data-fxc="#000000">
  <div class="rain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="inner">
    <h2 class="big e-name a" style="--d:.2s">Rayan Alyasi</h2>
    <dl class="credits a" style="--d:.45s">
      <dt>Now</dt><dd>DevOps engineering intern, Tabby</dd>
      <dt>Studying</dt><dd>Information Systems, KAU, <span data-yr="lower">year 2 of 4</span></dd>
      <dt>Fellowship</dt><dd>BCG Jeel Tamooh</dd>
      <dt>Next case</dt><dd>DevOps · Platform · Cloud · ML/AIOps</dd>
    </dl>
    <div class="ctas a" style="--d:.7s">
      <button class="btn solid" type="button" data-open="d-contact">Get in touch</button>
      <button class="btn" type="button" data-open="d-cv">View CV</button>
      <a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rayanalyasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/RayanAlyasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    </div>
    <div class="logostrip a" style="--d:.85s"><span>Worked, studied and won with</span><div class="lmq"><div class="ltk"><div class="lst"><span class="lg lg-tabby" role="img" aria-label="Tabby"></span><span class="lg lg-bcg" role="img" aria-label="BCG"></span><span class="lg lg-lucidya" role="img" aria-label="Lucidya"></span><span class="lg lg-kaust" role="img" aria-label="KAUST Academy"></span><span class="lg lg-tcs" role="img" aria-label="Tata Consultancy Services"></span><span class="lg lg-techhub" role="img" aria-label="TechHub"></span></div><div class="lst" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lg lg-tabby" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lg lg-bcg" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lg lg-lucidya" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lg lg-kaust" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lg lg-tcs" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lg lg-techhub" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div></div></div>
    <p class="homage a" style="--d:.95s">Designed as a tribute to 12 Angry Men (1957), my favourite film. Case closed.</p>
  </div>
</section>
